hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"360","It is narrated from Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""One-fifth of buried treasure is for the public treasury (Bayt al-Mal)."""
"361","It is narrated from Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""There is zakat of one-fifth on a buried treasure that is found."""
"362","It is narrated from Sayyiduna Ali (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""We have exempted you from zakat on horses and slaves (i.e., there is no zakat on them)."""
"363","It is narrated from Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""There is no zakat upon a Muslim in respect of his slave and his horse."""
"364","It is narrated from Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""There is no zakat upon a Muslim for his slave and his horse."""
